{'symbol': 'SEE', 'date': '2019-10-02 22:30:00', 'title': 'SEALED AIR CORPORATION DECLARES QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND, PAYABLE ON DECEMBER 20, 2019', 'text': 'SEALED AIR CORPORATION ANNOUNCED THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS HAS DECLARED A QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND OF $0.16 PER COMMON SHARE. THE DIVIDEND IS PAYABLE ON DECEMBER 20, 2019 TO STOCKHOLDERS OF RECORD AT THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON DECEMBER 6, 2019.'}